{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"lizang-e-o219","title":"阎温出围告急被执，向城呼援军将至以励守，拒绝马超劝降而被杀","accounts":[{"id":"lizang-a-51eb6a23fa96c9bd5522","label":"正文","text":"马超复围州所治冀城甚急","evidence":["lizang-q-89dfdfaa72b81fe3750d"]},{"id":"lizang-a-2a239706b71f49da5fa1","label":"正文","text":"州遣阎温密出告急于夏侯渊，温夜从水中潜出","evidence":["lizang-q-7353c01a1daa2f45e5e5"]},{"id":"lizang-a-66de695b9856dc92fd16","label":"正文","text":"贼见其迹遣人追遮，于显亲界得温执还诣超","evidence":["lizang-q-7bff386637620838822f"]},{"id":"lizang-a-4ef9491f11f6d3de1bbf","label":"正文","text":"超解缚诱温令谓城中东方无救，温伪许之，超载温诣城下","evidence":["lizang-q-79e2d5a338348a8c5b69"]},{"id":"lizang-a-fc41d5ac0ae2a9a65e35","label":"正文","text":"温向城大呼大军不过三日至勉之，城中皆泣称万岁","evidence":["lizang-q-4b598c453181a0006fb3"]},{"id":"lizang-a-389b38df2f938d2e6bb9","label":"正文","text":"超怒数切责徐诱，温言事君有死无贰，超遂杀之","evidence":["lizang-q-51ac58cebb7949befdf7"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0282","role":"围冀城；遣人追遮执温；解缚诱温；诱温不屈遂杀温","evidence":["lizang-q-89dfdfaa72b81fe3750d","lizang-q-7bff386637620838822f","lizang-q-79e2d5a338348a8c5b69","lizang-q-51ac58cebb7949befdf7"]},{"person":"lizang-p0075","role":"夜潜出告急，被执；伪许马超后向城呼“大军不过三日至”以励守，不屈被杀","evidence":["lizang-q-7353c01a1daa2f45e5e5","lizang-q-7bff386637620838822f","lizang-q-79e2d5a338348a8c5b69","lizang-q-4b598c453181a0006fb3","lizang-q-51ac58cebb7949befdf7"]},{"person":"wudi-p0278","role":"所告急之将","evidence":["lizang-q-7353c01a1daa2f45e5e5"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["lizang-q-89dfdfaa72b81fe3750d","lizang-q-7353c01a1daa2f45e5e5","lizang-q-7bff386637620838822f","lizang-q-79e2d5a338348a8c5b69","lizang-q-4b598c453181a0006fb3","lizang-q-51ac58cebb7949befdf7"]},"ordering_evidence":"lizang-q-89dfdfaa72b81fe3750d","source_order":[18,250,0],"order":3710}],"persons":[{"id":"lizang-p0075","name":"阎温","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0278","name":"夏侯渊","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0282","name":"马超","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"lizang-q-4b598c453181a0006fb3","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-8932614afb714115ca85","layer":"original","quote":"温向城大呼曰：“大军不过三日至，勉之！”城中皆泣，称“万岁","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":152,"end":181,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-51ac58cebb7949befdf7","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-8932614afb714115ca85","layer":"original","quote":"超怒数之曰：“足下不为命计邪？”温不应。时超攻城，久不下；故徐诱温，冀其改意。复谓温曰：“城中故人，有欲与吾同者不？”温又不应。遂切责之，温曰：“夫事君有死无贰，而卿乃欲令长者出不义之言，吾岂苟生者乎！”超遂杀之","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":186,"end":292,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-7353c01a1daa2f45e5e5","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-8932614afb714115ca85","layer":"original","quote":"州乃遣温密出，告急于夏侯渊。贼围数重，温夜从水中潜出","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":12,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-79e2d5a338348a8c5b69","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-8932614afb714115ca85","layer":"original","quote":"超解其缚，谓曰：“今成败可见，足下为孤城请救而执于人手，义何所施？若从吾言，反谓城中‘东方无救〖3〗’，此转祸为福之计也。不然，今为戮矣！”温伪许之，超乃载温诣城下","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":69,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-7bff386637620838822f","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-8932614afb714115ca85","layer":"original","quote":"明日，贼见其迹，遣人追遮之〖2〗。于显亲界，得温，执还诣超","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-89dfdfaa72b81fe3750d","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-8932614afb714115ca85","layer":"original","quote":"超复围州所治冀城，甚急","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":11,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
